.obo:489210:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489221:subset: clingen {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489222:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026243\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489223:subset: nord_rare {source=\"MONDO:NORD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489224:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489237:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026244\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489238:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489250:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/137215\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489256:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0015045\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489257:subset: nord_rare {source=\"MONDO:NORD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489258:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489269:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/113700\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489275:def: \"A rare and extreme form of psoriasis characterized by the appearance of sterile pustules which can take many patterns. All the main pathological features of the disease are accentuated. Generalized pustular psoriasis is clinically heterogeneous in its age at onset, precipitants, severity, and natural history. Many overlapping clinical entities are recognized. There is a relationship between these entities and plaque psoriasis, as some individuals may have episodes of plaque psoriasis preceding or following the generalized pustular psoriasis, but in others generalized pustular psoriasis occurs as the sole phenotype without plaque psoriasis at any time.\" [PMID:29630241]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489276:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026245\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489277:subset: nord_rare {source=\"MONDO:NORD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489278:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:247353\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489279:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:247353\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489280:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489300:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026246\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489301:subset: otar {source=\"MONDO:OTAR\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489302:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489313:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026247\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489314:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489324:def: \"A rare myopathy characterized by weakness of the muscles of the anterior compartment of lower limbs. Described as a more severe tibial muscular dystrophy phenotype, distal titinopathy is associated with earlier onset and progression to include soleus muscle and proximal muscles.\" [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40031/, PMID:24395473, PMID:27796757]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489325:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026248\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489326:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489335:def: \"A rare inherited muscular dystrophy characterized by the coexistence of limb-girdle weakness and early-onset diffuse joint contractures without cardiomyopathy.\" [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40031/, PMID:26581302]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489336:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026249\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489337:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489346:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026250\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489347:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489356:subset: clingen {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489357:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026251\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489358:subset: otar {source=\"MONDO:OTAR\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489359:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489372:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026252\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489373:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489391:def: \"A very rare anomaly (1 in 14,000 to 42,000 pregnancies; 1 in 7500 fetuses from 10 to 14 weeks of gestation) characterized by a complex anomaly of the anterior abdominal wall, severe kyphoscoliosis, rudimentary umbilical cord, and anatomical defects of the pelvis and lower limbs.\" [PMID:33115503]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489392:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026253\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489393:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489408:subset: clingen {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489409:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026254\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489410:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489419:subset: clingen {source=\"MONDO:CLINGEN\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489420:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026255\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489421:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489432:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026256\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489433:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489444:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0012774\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489445:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:213557\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489446:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:213557\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489447:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:489458:property_value: seeAlso \"https://rarediseases.info.nih.gov/diseases/12774/salivary-gland-type-cancer-of-the-breast\" 