ges/3289/Hemorrhagic-Fevers-Diseases.html]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:490980:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026292\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:490981:subset: mondo_curated_rare {source=\"https://science.jrank.org/pages/3289/Hemorrhagic-Fevers-Diseases.html\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:490982:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:490992:def: \"A rare, severe form of hypophosphatasia characterized by infantile rickets without elevated serum alkaline phosphatase (ALP) activity and a wide range of clinical manifestations due to hypomineralization. Individuals often present with these features in infancy or in the perinatal period.\" [https://www.clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40065/, PMID:32973344]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:490993:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026293\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:490994:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491002:def: \"A rare, moderate form of hypophosphatasia characterized by defective mineralization of bone and/or teeth, premature loss of teeth with intact roots, and reduced serum alkaline phosphatase (ALP) activity. Individuals can present with this form of hypophosphatasia in infancy, childhood, or adulthood. It can inherited via either autosomal dominant or autosomal recessive inheritance.\" [https://www.clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40065/, PMID:32973344]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491003:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026294\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491004:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491014:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026295\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491015:subset: obsoletion_candidate\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491016:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491030:def: \"A rare form of interstitial and vascular lung disease that presents as severe pulmonary hypertension and refractory hypoxemia early in life that is characterized by a lack of misalignment of the pulmonary veins.\" [https://doi.org/10.1016/B978-0-323-54605-8.00003-9, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432, https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0113-912X, PMID:33766794]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491031:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026296\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491032:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491044:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026297\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491045:subset: nord_rare {source=\"MONDO:NORD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491046:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491064:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026298\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491065:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491078:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026299\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491079:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491092:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026300\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491093:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491106:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026301\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491107:subset: otar {source=\"MONDO:OTAR\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491108:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491127:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026302\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491128:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491139:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/160750\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491146:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026303\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491147:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:491156:subset: doid_rare {source=\"DOID:0080649\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-r