or in two separated dural sacs. Other spinal cord malformations can be associated. Due to the comparable prognosis it is considered as a subtype of myelomeningocele.\" [Orphanet:645388]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504048:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026835\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504049:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645388\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504050:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504064:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026836\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504065:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645613\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504066:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504080:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026837\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504081:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645626\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504082:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504096:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026838\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504097:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645749\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504098:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645749\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504099:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504113:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026839\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504114:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645793\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504115:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645793\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504116:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504132:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026840\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504133:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645807\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:504134:subset: orphanet_rar