:642788\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506665:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506680:def: \"A rare group of closed spinal dysraphisms characterized by the presence of a stalk connecting the skin to the underlying spinal cord. The stalk contains variable combinations of non-functional neural tissue, fibrous mesenchymal tissue, and dermal/epidermal elements.\" [Orphanet:645193]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506681:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026989\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506682:subset: ordo_group_of_disorders {source=\"Orphanet:645193\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506683:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506697:def: \"A rare group of spinal cord lipoma characterized by the presence of extramedullary lipomatous mass located at any point along the spinal cord with or without a dural defect.\" [Orphanet:645273]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506698:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026990\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506699:subset: ordo_group_of_disorders {source=\"Orphanet:645273\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506700:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506715:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026991\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506716:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:647772\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506717:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:647772\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506718:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506732:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026992\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506733:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:647782\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506734:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:647782\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506735:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506749:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026993\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506750:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:648665\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506751:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:648665\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506752:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506767:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026994\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506768:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:648675\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506769:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:648675\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506770:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506784:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026995\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506785:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:648681\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506786:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:648681\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506787:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506801:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026996\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506802:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:648992\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506803:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:648992\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506804:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506818:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026997\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506819:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:649010\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506820:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:649010\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506821:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506835:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026998\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506836:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:649029\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506837:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:649029\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506838:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506852:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0026999\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506853:subset: ordo_group_of_disorders {source=\"Orphanet:649929\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506854:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506868:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027000\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506869:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:652514\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506870:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506883:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027001\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506884:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:656085\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506885:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506899:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027002\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506900:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:656126\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506901:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:656126\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506902:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506917:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027003\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506918:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506928:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620745\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506933:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027153\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506934:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:664430\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506935:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:664430\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506936:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506946:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620746\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506953:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027004\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506954:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506969:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027005\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506970:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506984:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027006\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506985:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506994:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620755\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:506999:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027007\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507000:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507010:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620757\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507015:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027008\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507016:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507025:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620762\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507030:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027009\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507031:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507040:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620767\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507045:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027010\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507046:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507055:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620772\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507060:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027011\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507061:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507070:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620774\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507075:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027012\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507076:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507085:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620775\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507090:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027013\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507091:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507100:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620776\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507105:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027014\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507106:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507115:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620777\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507120:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027015\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507121:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507130:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620780\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507135:def: \"A rare developmental defect during embryogenesis characterized by congenital absence of the optic nerve head, optic nerve fibers, retinal ganglion cells, and retinal blood vessels in a malformed eye. It often occurs unilaterally with otherwise normal brain development. In bilateral cases it is accompanied by other central nervous system malformations.\" [Orphanet:637064]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507136:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027016\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507137:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:637064\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507138:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:637064\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507139:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507153:def: \"A rare autoinflammatory syndrome characterized by a chronic-relapsing course of the combination of pyogenic arthritis, pyoderma gangrenosum, acne, and hidradenitis suppurativa (which, in addition to axillae and inguinal folds, can be observed on the face, neck, scalp, back, and buttocks, among others). Typical age of onset is adolescence to young adulthood, with the different signs and symptoms appearing simultaneously or subsequently.\" [Orphanet:641380]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507154:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027017\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507155:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:641380\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507156:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:641380\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507157:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507171:def: \"A rare closed dysraphism with stalk characterized by a dorsal midline dermal sinus tract lined by keratinizing stratified squamous epithelium extending to the the intrathecal space. Other components such as hair follicles and shafts, mesenchymal derivatives (blood vessels and fibrous tissue) and occasionally nerve fibers can be observed. Inflamed granulation tissue containing mixed neutrophils, plasma cells, lymphocytes, and histiocytes is consistently found in the tract. It can also be associated with an intradural dermoid cyst. This malformation is at risk to cause intrathecal infections (meningitis, empyema) that justify a prophylactic surgery.\" [Orphanet:645188]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507172:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027018\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507173:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645188\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507174:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645188\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507175:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507185:def: \"A rare dysraphic abnormality characterized by a persistent connection between the neural tissue and overlying skin. The stalk-like connection consists of a fibroneural tract (mainly composed of fibrous attenuated mesenchymal tissue and neural elements without an epithelial lining) connecting the skin lesion to the underlying dorsal surface of the spinal cord. Fibroneural stalk varies in thickness and complexity and they pass through the deep fascia, a bifid lamina/ the interspinous ligament, and the dura. It can be associated with filum anomaly. Chiari II malformation is not present.\" [Orphanet:645196]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507186:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027019\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507187:subset: ordo_group_of_disorders {source=\"Orphanet:645196\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507188:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507202:def: \"A rare dysraphic abnormality characterized by the infiltration of fatty tissue localized in the filum terminale, with abnormal conus shape. The spinal cord is typically attenuated and the limit between its end and the fatty filum is hard to distinguish. There are no additional spinal cord malformation, but it can be associated with vertebral abnormalities, anorectal malformation or other syndromic condition. It is named transitional for its intermediate image between an isolated filum lipoma and a terminal conus region lipoma.\" [Orphanet:645322]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507203:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027020\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507204:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645322\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507205:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645322\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507206:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507220:def: \"A rare dysraphic abnormality characterized by the infiltration of fatty tissue localized in the filum terminale, thickens and loses its flexibility, with normal conus shape, regardless of conus level. There is no other spinal cord malformation associated, but it can be associated with extraspinal malformation (ex: anorectal malformation) or syndromic situation.\" [Orphanet:645325]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507221:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027021\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507222:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645325\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507223:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645325\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507224:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507238:def: \"A rare closed dysraphism with terminal stalk characterized by persistent rudimentary spinal cord below conus. It contains non-functional neural tissue and is typically isolated. The diagnostic is suggested by attenuated conus without fat, further confirmed by pathological analysis (glioneuronal core with ependyma-lined lumen, nerve roots, and dorsal root ganglia). Differential diagnostic with intraoperative neurophysiological monitoring is mandatory as neuroimaging fails to distinguish it from functional conus.\" [Orphanet:645334]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507239:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027022\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507240:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645334\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507241:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645334\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507242:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507256:def: \"A rare lipomatous, dysraphic malformation characterized by attachment to the dorsal surface of the spinal cord but not extending to the conus. It can be associated with others features such as a stalk and vertebral bone abnormalities.\" [Orphanet:645362]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507257:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027023\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507258:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645362\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507259:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645362\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507260:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507274:def: \"A rare lipomatous, dysraphic malformation characterized by lipoma located wholly or partially at the conus.\" [Orphanet:645367]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507275:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027024\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507276:subset: ordo_group_of_disorders {source=\"Orphanet:645367\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507277:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507291:def: \"A very rare form of composite dysraphism characterized by the presence of a split cord malformation and a myeloschisis on one of the two hemicords. Hemicords can be in a single dural sac or in two separated dural sacs. Other spinal cord malformations can be associated. Due to the comparable prognosis it is considered as a subtype of myeloschisis.\" [Orphanet:645393]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507292:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027025\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507293:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645393\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507294:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507308:def: \"A rare open neural tube defect characterized by no other malformation than myeloschisis (spina bifida with a neural placode exposed at or below the skin plane and Chiari II malformation).\" [Orphanet:645401]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507309:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027026\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507310:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645401\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507311:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507326:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027027\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507327:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:646113\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507328:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:646113\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507329:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507343:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027028\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507344:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:650077\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507345:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:650077\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507346:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507360:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027029\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507361:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:650082\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507362:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:650082\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507363:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507377:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027030\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507378:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:650087\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507379:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:650087\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507380:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507394:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027031\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507395:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:650092\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507396:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:650092\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507397:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507411:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027032\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507412:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507423:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620779\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507428:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028082\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507429:subset: nord_rare {source=\"MONDO:NORD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507430:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507439:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620782\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507444:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027033\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507445:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507454:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620783\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507459:subset: doid_rare {source=\"DOID:0080223\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507460:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027034\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507461:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507471:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/phenotypicSeries/PS144200\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507476:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027035\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507477:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507481:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/phenotypicSeries/PS220150\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507486:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0016931\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507487:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:100032\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507488:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507505:def: \"Isolated arhinencephaly is a rare non-syndromic central nervous system malformation defined by the agenesis of the olfactory bulbs and tracts and characterized by complete congenital anosmia.\" [Orphanet:268936]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507506:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0020979\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507507:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:268936\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507508:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:268936\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507509:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507524:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027036\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507525:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507539:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027078\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507540:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507549:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620786\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507554:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:697356\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507555:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:697356\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507556:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507568:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620789\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507574:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027079\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507575:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507584:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620792\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507589:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027080\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507590:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507600:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620794\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507605:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027081\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507606:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507615:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620796\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507620:def: \"A rare dysraphic spinal cord lipoma characterized by the lipomatous mass extending ventrally to the dorsal root entry zone, indicating a more severe malformation of the spinal cord. The diagnosis can be suggested on imaging but usually confirmed during surgery.\" [Orphanet:645285]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507621:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027082\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507622:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645285\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507623:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645285\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507624:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507638:def: \"A rare closed lipomatous, dysraphic malformation of the lower spinal cord characterized by extramedullary lipomatous mass attached to the conus region. The conus is dysplastic and poorly delineated. Various morphological subtypes are recognized. Possible symptoms include bowel and bladder dysfunction and neuro-orthopedic deformity of the lower limbs.\" [Orphanet:645297]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507639:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027083\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507640:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645297\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507641:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645297\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507642:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507656:def: \"A rare spinal dysraphism characterized by a meningocele, containing a stalk, that is attached to the inner surface of the meningocele. The stalk can be posteriorly fibroneural (saccular limited dorsal myeloschisis) or the spinal cord itself (myelic limited dorsal malformation).\" [Orphanet:645319]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507657:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027084\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507658:subset: ordo_group_of_disorders {source=\"Orphanet:645319\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507659:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507674:def: \"A rare form of limited dorsal myeloschisis (LDM), characterized by a non saccular cutaneous stigmata (midline skin abnormality classically dimple, pit or sometimes angioma), the stalk is attached to this cutaneous stigmata. Fibroneural stalk varies in thickness and complexity.\" [Orphanet:645343]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507675:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027085\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507676:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645343\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507677:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645343\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507678:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507692:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027086\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507693:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:650097\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507694:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507707:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027087\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507708:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:650102\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507709:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507723:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027088\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507724:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507735:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620806\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507740:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028083\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507741:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507751:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620819\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507756:def: \"A rare form of extramedullary conus region spinal cord lipoma characterized by its location, extending from the poorly delineated tip of the conus.\" [Orphanet:645288]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507757:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027089\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507758:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645288\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507759:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507773:def: \"A rare form of extramedullary conus region spinal cord lipoma characterized by a location at the posterior surface of the conus and its tip. i.e-\\\"transitional\\\" between posterior and terminal conus region spinal cord lipoma.\" [Orphanet:645291]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507774:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027090\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507775:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645291\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507776:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507790:def: \"A rare form of conus region spinal cord lipoma characterized by its location where the interface between the lipoma and the spinal cord is strictcly above the level of the tip of the conus. The tip of the conus is readily delineated.\" [Orphanet:645294]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507791:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027091\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507792:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645294\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507793:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507807:def: \"A rare non-saccular limited dorsal myeloschisis histologically characterized by skin tissue with a jagged depression of squamous epithelium continued to subcutaneous mature adipose tissue with loose connective tissue. GFAP-immunopositive glial cells are embedded in the subcutaneous lipoma. The extradural and intradural stalk have cord-like fibrocollagenous tissue containing adipose tissue, peripheral nerve fibers, clusters of melanocytes, and skeletal muscle fibers.\" [Orphanet:645300]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507808:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027092\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507809:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645300\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507810:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507824:def: \"A rare non-saccular limited dorsal myeloschisis, in which the stalk histology is characterized by skin tissue with dermo-epidermal epithelium in continuity with a subcutaneous fibrocollagenous tract containing various ectopic tissues.\" [Orphanet:645310]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507825:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027093\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507826:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645310\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507827:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507841:def: \"A rare closed spinal dysraphism characterized by a myelocystocele at the termination of the spinal cord. It may be an isolated anomaly or be associated with other defects, including sacral agenesis, anorectal and genitourinary anomalies. The conus is not identifiable. The myelocystocele sac may have a significant lipomatous component (terminal lipomyelocystocele).\" [Orphanet:645337]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507842:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027094\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507843:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645337\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507844:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645337\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507845:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507860:def: \"A rare form of limited dorsal myeloschisis (LDM), characterized by the stalk attached to the apex of a fully epithelialized meningocele. Chiari II malformation is not present.\" [Orphanet:645354]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507861:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027095\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507862:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645354\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507863:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645354\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507864:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507878:def: \"A rare intermediate form of open dysraphism between myelomeningocele and saccular limited dorsal myeloschisis without fulfilling the characteristics of one of these two diagnosis, characterized by stretched neurulated spinal cord attached at the dome of a sac. Partial cerebral signs of open dysraphism can be observed and the meningocele is usually poorly epithelialized.\" [Orphanet:645378]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507879:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027096\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507880:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:645378\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507881:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:645378\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507882:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507896:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028084\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507897:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507909:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620836\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507914:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027097\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507915:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507924:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/620840\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507929:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027098\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507930:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507938:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/105210\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507943:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027099\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507944:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507948:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/209920\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:507953:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027100\", sourc