d by seizures, disabling headaches, and stroke-like symptoms with progressive neurological deficits due to a proliferative response to chronic parenchymal ischaemia. Normal brain parenchyma is interspersed throughout the vascular malformation. Hemorrhagic presentations are uncommon; however, when present, the risk of reccurence is higher in such patients than in those with classic cerebral arteriovenous malformation.\" [Orphanet:692271]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510784:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:692271\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510785:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:692271\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510786:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510794:def: \"A rare cardiovascular disorder characterized by defective intracellular lipolysis of long-chain triglycerides (LCTG), resulting in heart failure and diffuse atherosclerosis.\" [Orphanet:692305]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510795:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:692305\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510796:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:692305\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510797:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510805:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:692812\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510806:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:692812\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510807:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510817:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:694228\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510818:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:694228\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510819:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510827:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:694356\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510828:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:694356\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510829:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:510837:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orp