is frequently associated with rapidly progressive interstitial lung disease and high mortality rates. (PMID:35134633)\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512078:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027223\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512079:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512093:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027224\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512094:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512103:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027225\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512104:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512114:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027226\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512115:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512125:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027227\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512126:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512137:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027228\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512138:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512151:comment: A subset of patients with CADM are positive for the specific autoantibody MDA-5. Patients with CADM and its subtypes are at risk of having associated interstitial lung disease and internal malignancies. (PMID:39005210)\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512152:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027229\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512153:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512203:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:696175\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512204:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:696175\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512205:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512227:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027336\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512228:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512237:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028128\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512238:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512251:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028129\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512252:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512273:def: \"A rare genetic disorder characterized by abnormal blood vessels in the brain (cerebral vasculature defects), eye development defects (ocular dysgenesis), muscle disease (myopathy) and kidney abnormalities (renal pathology) due to a variation in the COL4A1 or COL4A2 gene.\" [https://rarediseases.org/rare-diseases/col4a1-a2-related-disorders/]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512274:comment: The full spectrum of this syndrome is not yet completely characterized and there are many other aspects of the syndrome including abnormalities affecting the structure of the brain (cerebral cortical abnormalities) and lung (pulmonary) abnormalities that can be part of the spectrum of the disease. https://rarediseases.org/rare-diseases/col4a1-a2-related-disorders/\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512275:synonym: \"COL4A1/A2 syndrome\" EXACT [https://rarediseases.org/rare-diseases/col4a1-a2-related-disorders/]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512276:synonym: \"Gould syndrome\" EXACT [https://rarediseases.org/rare-diseases/col4a1-a2-related-disorders/]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512285:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028130\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512286:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512298:subset: doid_rare {source=\"DOID:0110913\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512299:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028131\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512300:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:247676\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512301:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512322:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/146300\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512329:def: \"Childhood-onset hypophosphatasia is a rare, mildform of hypophosphatasia characterized by onset after six months of age and widely variable clinical features from low bone mineral density for age, to unexplained fractures,skeletal deformities,and rickets with short stature and waddling gait.\" [Orphanet:247667]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512330:subset: doid_rare {source=\"DOID:0110915\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512331:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028132\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512332:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:247667\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512333:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512350:property_value: seeAlso \"https://rarediseases.info.nih.gov/diseases/8735/childhood-hypophosphatasia\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"GARD:0008735\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512356:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/241510\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512363:def: \"Infantile hypophosphatasia (I-HPP) is a very rare, severe form of hypophosphatasia characterized by infantile rickets without elevated serum alkaline phosphatase (ALP) activity and a wide range of clinical manifestations due to hypomineralization.\" [Orphanet:247651]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512364:subset: doid_rare {source=\"DOID:0110914\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512365:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028133\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512366:subset: ordo_subtype_of_a_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:247651\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512367:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512386:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/241500\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512394:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028134\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512395:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512406:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028135\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512407:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512418:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028136\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512419:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512430:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028137\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512431:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512442:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028138\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512443:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512454:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028139\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512455:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512462:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/entry/214800\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512500:subset: inferred_rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512501:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512517:subset: inferred_rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512518:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512527:subset: inferred_rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512528:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512538:subset: inferred_rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512539:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512566:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027111\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512567:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512578:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027112\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512579:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512602:def: \"A rare clinical disorder characterized by at least three recurrent episodes of meningitis associated with spontaneous recovery with or without antiviral therapy. Herpes simplex virus type 2 has frequently been implicated in the setting of this illness. RBLM is rare with prevalence rates estimated at 2 per 100,000 persons.\" [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9310-0163, PMID:36304598]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512603:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027230\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512604:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512616:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027231\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512617:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512626:def: \"Happle-Tinschert syndrome (HTS) is a rare, sporadic, multisystem disorder characterized by hypo- and hyperpigmented skin patches following Blaschko's lines, plus acral skeletal and other abnormalities and is characterized by basaloid follicular hamartomas. HTS is caused by a postzygotic mutation in the SMO gene (c.1234C>T, p.Leu412Phe).\" [PMID:31120550]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512627:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027232\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512628:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512651:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028140\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512652:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512662:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028141\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512663:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512674:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027113\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512675:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512691:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027114\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512692:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512703:def: \"A rare congenital brain disorder characterized by complete or almost near-complete unilateral absence of the cortical cortex, which is filled by a sac of cerebrospinal fluid. The presumed cause is a prenatal vascular disruption with occlusion of the carotid artery territories ipsilateral to the damaged brain.\" [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9310-0163, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0587-4693, PMID:23324549]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512704:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027337\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512705:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512740:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027438\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512741:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:689001\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512742:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:689001\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512743:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512761:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027233\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512762:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512799:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027338\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512800:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512810:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027234\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512811:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512824:def: \"Group of rare heritable connective tissue disorders, characterized by a variable degree of short stature, skeletal dysplasia, joint laxity, cutaneous anomalies, dysmorphism, heart malformation, and developmental delay. The LK genes encode for enzymes that add glycosaminoglycan chains onto proteoglycans via a common tetrasaccharide linker region.\" [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5493-2602, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0587-4693, PMID:31196143, PMID:31438591, PMID:37657630]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512834:def: \"A group of rare genetic conditions caused by variants in the NDUFB11 gene. Presentation is heterogenous including neurologic, cardiac, ocular, and dermatological abnormalities.\" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0587-4693, https://orcid.org/0000-001-9310-0163, PMID:25772934, PMID:25921236, PMID:26741492, PMID:27102574]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512861:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028142\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512862:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512878:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027235\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512879:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512889:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027236\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512890:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512903:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027115\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512904:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512918:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027116\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512919:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:611223\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512920:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:611223\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512921:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512939:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027117\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512940:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:370980\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512941:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:370980\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512942:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512962:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027237\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512963:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512974:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027238\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512975:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512986:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027239\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512987:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:512999:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027240\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513000:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513012:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027241\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513013:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513023:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028143\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513024:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513040:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027242\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513041:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513055:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027243\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513056:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513066:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027244\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513067:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513081:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027245\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513082:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513096:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027246\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513097:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513111:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027247\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513112:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513126:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027248\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513127:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513141:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027249\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513142:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513155:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027250\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513156:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513169:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027251\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513170:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513183:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027252\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513184:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513197:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027253\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513198:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513208:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027254\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513209:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513220:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027255\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513221:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513241:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027257\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513242:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513252:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027258\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513253:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513262:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028144\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513263:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513274:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028145\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513275:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513286:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028146\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513287:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513302:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028147\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513303:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513314:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028148\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513315:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513329:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028149\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513330:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513341:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027439\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513342:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513352:def: \"A rare neurologic disease characterized by neonatal hypotonia, global developmental delay, feeding difficulties, and often seizures or seizure-like episodes. Other frequently observed signs and symptoms include variable dysmorphic features, myopathic facies, respiratory problems, and visual abnormalities, such as strabismus or esotropia. Brain imaging may show delayed myelination and other white matter abnormalities.\" [Orphanet:438213]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513353:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027440\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513354:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:438213\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513355:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:438213\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513356:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513392:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028150\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513393:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513404:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028151\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513405:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513419:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028152\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513420:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513435:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028153\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513436:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513449:def: \"A neurodevelopmental disorder caused by variation in the GRIN1 gene. It is characterized by mild-to-profound developmental delay/intellectual disability (DD/ID) in all affected individuals. Other common manifestations are epilepsy, muscular hypotonia, movement disorders, spasticity, feeding difficulties, and behavior issues. A subset of individuals show a malformation of cortical development consisting of extensive and diffuse bilateral polymicrogyria.\" [PMID:31219694]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513450:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028154\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513451:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513462:def: \"A rare, life-threatening fetal condition resulting complete or partial obstruction of the fetal upper airways. Laryngeal atresia is the most frequent cause, but other etiologies, such as laryngeal cyst, subglottic stenosis or atresia, tracheal atresia, and laryngeal or tracheal agenesis are also included.\" [PMID:30572501, PMID:34345328]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513463:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0027441\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513464:subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:700286\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513465:subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:700286\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513466:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513482:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028155\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513483:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513508:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028156\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513509:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513519:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028157\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513520:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513529:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028158\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513530:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513540:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028159\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513541:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513551:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028160\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513552:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513562:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028161\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513563:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513578:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028162\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513579:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513595:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028163\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513596:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513607:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028164\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513608:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513618:def: \"A rare iatrogenic disease characterized by paradoxical nasal obstruction and symptoms including air hunger and suffocation-like breathing sensation, nasal dryness and crusting, burning pain or cold airflow sensation, impaired sleep and cognitive function and severe anxiety and depression, and typically occurs after surgical reduction or removal of nasal turbinates.\" [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9310-0163, PMID:27557473, PMID:39126290]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513619:comment: ENS is often misdiagnosed as psychiatric in origin due to the disproportionate suffering compared to physical exam findings. ENS results from disruption of normal nasal airflow dynamics, mucosal sensory feedback, and humidification, typically after aggressive surgical intervention on the nasal turbinates. Estimated prevalence: <1 in 10,000, though underreporting and misdiagnosis likely make this an underestimate. ENS is currently considered a rare, post-surgical complication, with cases reported globally but concentrated among ENT surgical patients. No universally accepted biomarker exists. Diagnosis is based on symptoms, medical history and imaging. There is no cure. Symptom management includes nasal moisturization (saline gels, humidification), nerve modulating agents (e.g., amitriptyline, gabapentin) nasal implants to restore airflow resistance and cognitive-behavioral therapy and psychiatric support. ENS most often develops after surgery and is considered an iatrogenic condition because its other causes also result from medical interventions, such as electrocautery or laser procedures that cause turbinate trauma.\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513620:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028165\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513621:subset: mondo_curated_rare {source=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7638-4659\", source=\"PMID:35155777\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513622:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513640:def: \"A rare semidominant genetic skeletal disorder caused by a variation in ACAN gene, characterized by short stature with variable phenotypic features which may include osteochondritis dissecans, advanced bone age, early-onset arthritis, and/or features consistent with spondyloepiphyseal dysplasia, Kimberley type caused by a single allele whereas biallelic variation can cause spondyloepimetaphyseal dysplasia, aggrecan type.\" [PMID:27311816, PMID:35434101]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513662:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028166\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513663:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513673:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028167\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513674:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513694:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028168\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513695:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513701:property_value: skos:exactMatch https://omim.org/phenotypicSeries/PS179800\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513708:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028169\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513709:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513720:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028170\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513721:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513731:def: \"A rare autoimmune disease of early childhood, marked by the simultaneous or sequential immune attack on red blood cells and liver cells.\" [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9310-0163, PMID:33824929, PMID:39084551, PMID:40110893]\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513733:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028171\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513734:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513748:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028172\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513749:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513762:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028173\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513763:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513780:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028174\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513781:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513792:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028175\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513793:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513805:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028176\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513806:subset: rare\nsrc/ontology/subsets/mondo-rare.obo:513820:subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028177\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsrc/ontology/subsets/m